   "sayDuring": [
    {
     "day": 10,
     "line": "◈ CRISIS — THE BREACH. It got INSIDE. The haven was supposed to be the safe place — the one place. It isn’t."
    },
    {
     "day": 10,
     "line": "SYSTEM: \"Perimeter violated! This is unprecedented! ...Is this unprecedented? Checking. Yes. Unprecedented.\""
    },
    {
     "day": 10,
     "line": "The village is rattled. Everyone's jumpy — eyes on the treeline."
    },
    {
     "day": 10,
     "line": "You don't know what that was. Something displaced a LOT of water, and it wasn't a log. Someone at the haven should hear about this."
    },
    {
     "day": 10,
     "line": "⚔ THE ANACONDA EMPRESS! You're on your own."
    },
    {
     "day": 10,
     "line": "Turn-based now. Tap a tile to move — speed is squares. Then act."
    },
    {
     "day": 10,
     "line": "🐗 This one came with the raid on Haven — it was with the teeth at the door, not a lone wanderer."
    },
    {
     "day": 10,
     "line": "(The game is telling you something: this is bigger than one person. Talk to your companions — \"We should name this. Us.\")"
    }
   ],
